    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/32afcf06f9c1b4045567bb523ab38de4.avif?t=1753950276\" width=513 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kemopop! is an active puzzle eroge featuring several cute, effeminate kemono (&quot;furry&quot;) boys, all working in food service. Match sweets and make them undress...!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like feminine boys, especially ones who are well-endowed (and sometimes, <i>very</i> well endowed), this is what you've been waiting for. Kemopop! features characters from various artists, in over 30+ stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/c22abee6a6b09744e96c1a812d9159d9.avif?t=1753950276\" width=783 height=1000 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hand-Drawn Original Content:</strong> All artwork was made special for Kemopop!. Play stages made in collaboration with excellent kemono artists!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Browse the artwork you've unlocked, and use it to generate wallpaper...!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Universal Controls:</strong> Play with just a mouse, keyboard, touchscreen, or controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Your Character Here:</strong> Do you have artwork of a character and a bit of free time? Put it in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gumball Machine:</strong> Unlock additional content: new sweets, another half of the soundtrack, fanart, and developer commentary!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skip It All:</strong> Don't wanna play? Use the Bonus settings to get right to the <i>content</i>!!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/32afcf06f9c1b4045567bb523ab38de4.avif?t=1753950276\" width=513 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kemopop! is an active puzzle eroge featuring several cute, effeminate kemono (&quot;furry&quot;) boys, all working in food service. Match sweets and make them undress...!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like feminine boys, especially ones who are well-endowed (and sometimes, <i>very</i> well endowed), this is what you've been waiting for. Kemopop! features characters from various artists, in over 30+ stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/c22abee6a6b09744e96c1a812d9159d9.avif?t=1753950276\" width=783 height=1000 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hand-Drawn Original Content:</strong> All artwork was made special for Kemopop!. Play stages made in collaboration with excellent kemono artists!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Browse the artwork you've unlocked, and use it to generate wallpaper...!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Universal Controls:</strong> Play with just a mouse, keyboard, touchscreen, or controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Your Character Here:</strong> Do you have artwork of a character and a bit of free time? Put it in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gumball Machine:</strong> Unlock additional content: new sweets, another half of the soundtrack, fanart, and developer commentary!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skip It All:</strong> Don't wanna play? Use the Bonus settings to get right to the <i>content</i>!!</p></li></ul>",
